WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:11.204
Invoices across countries and currencies, reviewed by hand, every month. One payment outside the rules is enough to lose control.

2
00:00:11.754 --> 00:00:16.322
Invoices arrive by email, as PDFs or by chat.

3
00:00:16.872 --> 00:00:23.880
Someone compares them with what was agreed, asks for approval by chat and creates the payment by hand, in another currency and country.

4
00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:30.262
It is reconciled in a spreadsheet. Every month. If someone is available.

5
00:00:30.812 --> 00:00:36.884
Thesaurus. The accounts payable agent for global companies.

6
00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:44.462
It receives every invoice: vendor portal, direct upload, pasted text or email.

7
00:00:45.012 --> 00:00:53.816
AI reads it: payee, amount, currency, account and dates, with its confidence level.

8
00:00:54.366 --> 00:01:01.394
Code checks 13 rules, from payee to budget, with the day's exchange rate.

9
00:01:01.944 --> 00:01:09.880
And it decides: PAY, STOP or ESCALATE. PAY is only written when all 13 rules pass.

10
00:01:10.430 --> 00:01:17.674
When something falls outside the rules, it asks a concrete question. A person approves in one click.

11
00:01:18.224 --> 00:01:26.588
Every decision keeps its record: what it read, what it decided and the arithmetic. And you can ask it.

12
00:01:27.138 --> 00:01:33.058
AI reads. Code decides. A person approves.

13
00:01:33.608 --> 00:01:41.136
Isolation per company. Immutable record. It never pays outside the rules.

14
00:01:41.686 --> 00:01:47.814
In production: Andina Labs, a sample company with 29 invoices.

15
00:01:48.364 --> 00:01:53.940
The inbox: what is due, what awaits approval and the agent's autonomy.

16
00:01:54.490 --> 00:02:01.146
On every invoice: what it read, with its confidence, and the 13 rules with their arithmetic.

17
00:02:01.696 --> 00:02:07.392
When an invoice exceeds the threshold, the question is concrete and the answer is one click.

18
00:02:07.942 --> 00:02:13.902
The period reports: 62% autonomy and 0 violations.

19
00:02:14.452 --> 00:02:20.568
And vendors send their invoices from their own portal, also from a phone.

20
00:02:21.118 --> 00:02:29.682
Thesaurus. Ready to connect to Blinka. Try it with your own company.
